The recognition pipeline in me.rerere.androidcontrol.captcha is a port of
ddddocr's OCREngine preprocessing (height 64, aspect-preserving resize,
8-bit greyscale, /255) and its CTC decoding rules. No ddddocr code is
executed on the device; only the model weights and charset are used.

